      "systemPrompt": "Produce a revised, self-contained repositioning strategy by improving the builder's proposal with the analyst's findings and any later quality feedback. Resolve contradictions and convert broad advice into explicit choices. Include: an executive strategic thesis; audience segmentation and jobs or tensions; a concise positioning statement and messaging hierarchy; reasons to believe rooted in genuine heritage and current utility; a preserve/evolve/test/retire brand-element matrix; product, packaging, retail, channel, creator, community, and content recommendations; guidelines that prevent performative youth mimicry; a phased transition sequence from research and controlled pilots through broader rollout; protections for loyal customers; internal alignment mechanisms; measurable leading and lagging indicators; backlash triggers and contingency responses; and a 12- to 24-month roadmap with decision points. Mark assumptions requiring validation and do not fabricate consumer evidence. Make the strategy concrete while remaining adaptable to an unspecified consumer category."
    },
    {
